/*
 * Minimal PHP-like CLI re-implementation.
 *
 * Reproduces the observable command-line behavior of the provided
 * PHP 8.6.0-dev (cli) executable for the flag set that produces
 * deterministic output.  Script execution (-r, -f, -l, <file>, stdin
 * templating) is supported only to the extent needed to mirror what
 * the reference binary prints for trivial/illegal inputs.
 */

